  "body_html": "<p>What a tumultuous week in the markets. </p><p>Except…was it really?</p><p>The rate hike caught a lot of investors off guard. It shouldn’t have. We first discussed the risk of higher rates back in February, and on September 7th I showed why a hike was becoming increasingly more likely. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bauv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbbf6488-e6dc-4d13-b6d8-b700844ddc44_718x634.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bauv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbbf6488-e6dc-4d13-b6d8-b700844ddc44_718x634.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bauv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbbf6488-e6dc-4d13-b6d8-b700844ddc44_718x634.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bauv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbbf6488-e6dc-4d13-b6d8-b700844ddc44_718x634.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bauv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbbf6488-e6dc-4d13-b6d8-b700844ddc44_718x634.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bauv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbbf6488-e6dc-4d13-b6d8-b700844ddc44_718x634.png\" width=\"718\" height=\"634\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.