0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Noted the high % chance of raised rates back on 07 September 2026. </figcaption></figure></div><p>So where do I stand today, now that we have begun the rate hikes? </p><h4>Still your resident permabull. </h4><p>The initial reaction was exactly what you’d expect: stocks dropped and the VIX spike. But what happened next is more important. The market reclaimed the lost price action the same day and following day, while the VIX quickly fell back below its moving average. </p><p>For now, I haven’t seen enough deterioration in the signal I follow to change the bullish thesis I’ve maintained since June 9th, 2025. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png\" width=\"1402\" height=\"766\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:766,&quot;width&quot;:1402,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:146338,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/216341705?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JOt3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb114da44-b240-4962-94f3-ad1fb1f644ce_1402x766.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Volatility decreasing in the VIX, while stocks trending back up, in a macro downtrend, is optimistic for a bullish continuation. </figcaption></figure></div><p>No, I won’t be a permabull forever. When I see signals that it is time to exit, such as a major reputable company failing, delusional euphoria on social media, or a break in price structure, I will gladly let update you. </p><p>I realize many of you have busy lives, all of these posts remain relevant today. </p><p>In case you missed any of these, here’s what we actually did this week:</p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/flash-update-this-recession-resistant?r=4z8lgl\">Bought This Recession Resistant Stock (click here)</a></h4><ul><li><p>What I bought as rate risk increased recession risks, and why. </p></li></ul><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-found-3-stocks-hiding-among-389?r=4z8lgl\">The 3 Best Stocks out of 389 IPOs</a></h4><ul><li><p>I screened hundreds of IPOs from the last 2-3 years down to three that are showing similarities to my 2024 Palantir call.  </p></li></ul><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-investors-should-be-careful\">Why I’m Cautious About Nvidia</a></h4><ul><li><p>One of the market’s most popular stocks and why I think there are better opportunities elsewhere. </p></li></ul><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Make sure you take some time off and refresh, especially after wild weeks like this one. You want to come in fresh and sharp when the market opens on Monday. <span>If you ever have questions, feel free to tag me </span><em>during market hours</em><span> in the</span><strong> <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d18286d6-5152-4f20-85c8-cedb68ee0e71\">Main Chat</a></strong><span>. Always happy to explain some of the crazy 🤪 things I say on the internet.</span></p><p><span>I’ll see you Monday, and thanks for stopping by! </span></p><h4><strong>If you like this content, please like ❤️and re-stack 🔄 this post! </strong></h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/rates-went-up-heres-what-im-doing?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/rates-went-up-heres-what-im-doing?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/rates-went-up-heres-what-im-doing?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
